                <pb facs="0567" n="455" sameAs="frus:frus1910/pg455"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Sherrill to
                        the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Buenos
                                Aires</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1910-05-18"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">May 18,
                    1910</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Argentine minister for foreign affairs says he is telegraphing Ecuadorian
                    minister for foreign affairs in accordance with your May 17. Argentine minister
                    for foreign affairs reiterates that his minister at Lima is already instructed
                    to sign either the Argentine Spanish text or the United States text, leaving the
                    Brazilian minister to sign such text as pleases him.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sherrill.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
